name=Requiem of the Dead: Dragonfly
id=Dragonfly
modversion=1.1.0
require=RFTDCore
description=Dragonfly is the admin command center for the Requiem of the Dead mod family: the Growl-skinned command deck (sidebar badge or the sandbox keybind, default Shift+U) with player management, live server state, an item editor, a console/log view, the Longstrider map and tour tools, and a coordinates HUD. Sibling RFTD mods register their own tabs and per-row actions into the deck when installed, and every tab remembers its own window size. Also carries the family's PLAYER panel - the ungated tide-blue sibling (blue badge under CLIENT) where every player finds their own settings, their claimed vehicles with a live parts inspector, and the vehicle-part crafting Workshop, without leaving the game. Includes the keybindable gate that hides admin/debug right-click options. Deck access is sandbox-tiered (Admin only by default); the player panel is for everyone. Requires Requiem of the Dead: Core (RFTDCore). Designed for dedicated multiplayer servers.
pzversion=42
